# Title -> save list -> first save -> Load, then stand still (no further input; never advance the story).
# A reordered/new save list changes the destination. first-save-fast.input uses shorter, warm-start waits.
# Append measurement steps (mark / wait / fps / shot / dump / trace) after the scene settles.
wait 30000
tap x 120
wait 3000
tap x 120
wait 2500
tap x 120
wait 30000
mark scene
